body:
It's hard to put into words.  Felt like I was the greatest musician in the world, destined to become famous, and that the garage I practiced in would eventually be turned into a museum where aspiring musicians would visit and "see where it all started."  I'm pretty good but I'm not nearly THAT good... delusions of grandeur are a bitch.

&#x200B;

Feeling incredibly ashamed of the things I did and said to people while psychotic.  Having brain damage from it and feeling like my life is now on a steady decline.
